Subject: [PATCH] iOS: resolve FlutterViewController for UIScene (fix nil
 window crash)

- Replace delegate.window force-unwrap with connectedScenes window walk
- Fix handle() double-invoking FlutterMethodNotImplemented
- Podspec: allow arm64 iOS simulators (drop VALID_ARCHS x86_64 only)
- pubspec: widen SDK constraint for Dart 3 / Flutter 3 apps

